A small software company that automates large operational data exports.

!!! What is happening this week

* ''A renewal depends on an honest export answer'' — Lumen's scheduled exports fail above 50,000 rows. The fix is known but still needs load and cancellation tests before the team can promise a release.
* ''Release 2.8 has one risky late decision'' — The audit page is ready. Engineering must decide whether the export timeout fix is safe enough for 2.8.
* ''A new engineer starts while the team is busy'' — Theo's first week is planned, but no one owns the staging access request yet.

